# Build-context hygiene for the Linux image (Linux/Dockerfile).
#
# The working tree is ~13 GB, almost all of it generated: Compressor's build
# trees and download cache (10.6 GB), the CLI's DerivedData (840 MB) and .git
# (683 MB).  The Linux build needs the framework sources and Linux/ itself, so
# everything below is excluded from the context.  Keep this list in step with
# the big generated directories; see LIBRARIES.md for what Compressor writes
# where.
.git
.cli-deriveddata
.idea
.DS_Store
**/xcuserdata*
Compressor/build
Compressor/src
Compressor/library
Compressor/media
Linux/build
